248548001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Milestone: epidemic-chocolaty-imago plan review PASS persisted and independently verified certified at code SHA ae4030bd4a920762e27971f59a7aafdc4fcc0026. Review ran against an isolated current tickets clone carrying the four documented local identity/attestation files, avoiding bug agrologic-oval-bobolink concurrent origin/tickets ref updates. Ticket atomically claimed open -> in_progress with the configured default assignee. Remaining P6 advisory concerns intentionally paired report fields and is accepted; no scope or behavioral ambiguity remains. Landing method: single Gerrit change to refs/for/main, then wait for LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 before Submit and close.","timestamp":1787530039566148001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"TDD RED milestone for epidemic-chocolaty-imago. Contract card: authority = ticket ACs plus absurd-zoometric-bobwhite measured-layer definitions; trigger = a real standalone tickets git repo with packed objects and known checkout bytes; production seam = rebar._store.footprint.measure_tracker; tier = unit over a real temporary git repository because filesystem/Git layout is the mechanism; postconditions = exact pack, checkout logical/allocated/file count, Git-directory, whole logical arithmetic, ref/tip, and standalone scope; control = adding one one-byte path changes checkout logical bytes and file count exactly; gate = focused pytest then make test. Full oracle also covers linked-worktree scope, hardlink inode de-duplication, missing st_blocks, fresh-clone JSON/schema/text, read-only refs/worktree, invalid-ref cleanup, registry classification, and no threshold/verdict. Full run: 11 intended failures / 54 existing passes. After physical holdout, visible happy path alone fails on the explicit NotImplementedError sentinel. Edge, failure, schema, registry, and CLI E2E tests have been removed from the implementation worktree. Surface census: CLI in scope; public top-level library facade out (reusable internal store seam only); MCP/API out; automated callers expressly prohibited; dual-direction not applicable to this read-only operation.","timestamp":1787531510398595001}],"created_at":1787527349083896001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"d9890e97-0b41-4e59-a855-870f381375a6","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"0754-cfc5-e451-4e9b"}],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","0754-cfc5-e451-4e9b"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"c878-0f5f-21bd-4b60","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Implement opt-in tickets-store footprint reporting; prepare targeted reclaim to quiet-window gate","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["807e4369-0721-4a52-b258-53f3aeddecd7","d9890e97-0b41-4e59-a855-870f381375a6","18f6966c-09c1-41ed-96fc-d29add582ef8","4db650c9-5678-4425-86d2-f78a75fadb95","12c4b5e5-ea82-49cc-a945-16bd57b0cd37"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787548193669273001,"uuid":"6f24732d-1529-4a64-8d44-bd692c3d7e7f"}